<article class="zstar-case">
  <header class="zstar-hero">
    <a class="case-back" href="<%- url_for('/#projects') %>">← 返回项目</a>
    <img class="zstar-hero-bg" src="<%- url_for('/images/portfolio-hd/zstar-group.png') %>" alt="哔哩哔哩幻星虚拟数字人角色视觉">
    <canvas class="zstar-color-ripple" aria-hidden="true"></canvas>
    <span class="zstar-ripple-cursor" aria-hidden="true"></span>
    <div class="zstar-hero-shade"></div>
    <div class="zstar-hero-copy z-reveal">
      <p class="zstar-kicker">BILIBILI · VIRTUAL HUMAN</p>
      <h1>幻星项目</h1>
      <p class="zstar-hero-lead">从虚拟形象产品研发，到角色视觉体系与内容生产管线建设。</p>
      <div class="zstar-tags"><span>3D 美术</span><span>视觉设计</span><span>AIGC</span><span>制作管线</span></div>
    </div>
  </header>

  <section class="zstar-section zstar-background">
    <div class="zstar-section-index">01 / 项目背景</div>
    <div class="zstar-heading z-reveal"><div><p class="zstar-kicker">PROJECT BACKGROUND</p><h2>虚拟直播持续增长，创作者需要更自由的表达。</h2></div><p>虚拟内容成为新的创作与社交方式，但高门槛的形象制作、有限的角色差异和低效的内容生产，仍限制着普通用户进入。</p></div>
    <div class="zstar-metrics z-reveal"><article><strong>1000<span>亿+</span></strong><p>虚拟内容市场规模</p></article><article><strong>23<span>万+</span></strong><p>B 站虚拟主播</p></article><article><strong>190<span>%</span></strong><p>行业同比增长</p></article></div>
    <div class="zstar-context-note z-reveal"><b>机会判断</b><p>通过低门槛的捏脸换装工具与鲜明的 IP 角色，让用户快速拥有虚拟形象，也让平台获得可持续扩展的内容资产。</p></div>
  </section>

  <section class="zstar-section zstar-goals">
    <div class="zstar-section-index">02 / 目标与路径</div>
    <div class="zstar-heading compact z-reveal"><div><p class="zstar-kicker">PROJECT GOAL</p><h2>让每个人，拥有自己的虚拟形象。</h2></div><p>项目分为两个相互承接的阶段：先建立可自由组合的产品能力，再以代表性角色验证内容与商业价值。</p></div>
    <div class="zstar-phase-grid z-reveal">
      <article><header><strong>01</strong><div><span>PRODUCT FOUNDATION</span><h3>捏脸换装系统搭建</h3></div></header><div class="zstar-phase-body"><div><b>目标</b><p>建立用户可自由定制的虚拟形象系统。</p></div><div><b>挑战</b><p>角色风格需要差异化，多线并行下制作资源有限。</p></div><div><b>行动</b><p>调研视觉风格，建立生产标准与外部协作机制。</p></div></div></article>
      <article><header><strong>02</strong><div><span>CONTENT &amp; IP</span><h3>数字人 IP 孵化</h3></div></header><div class="zstar-phase-body"><div><b>目标</b><p>验证角色商业化与市场接受度。</p></div><div><b>挑战</b><p>角色识别度不足，内容产出形式受到限制。</p></div><div><b>行动</b><p>融合 Avatar 工具与角色设定，推进跨团队内容合作。</p></div></div></article>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="zstar-section zstar-role">
    <div class="zstar-section-index">03 / 我的职责</div>
    <div class="zstar-heading compact z-reveal"><div><p class="zstar-kicker">MY ROLE</p><h2>连接创意、生产与落地。</h2></div><p>不只完成单个角色，而是把审美判断转化为可持续生产的标准、流程与协作语言。</p></div>
    <div class="zstar-role-board z-reveal">
      <aside><span>PROJECT ROLE</span><h3>3D 设计负责人</h3><p>负责 3D 美术资产、角色视觉、制作管线与项目推进，在效果、效率和产品实现之间持续校准。</p><div class="zstar-role-tags"><i>视觉定义</i><i>管线搭建</i><i>质量验收</i><i>项目管理</i></div></aside>
      <div class="zstar-workstreams"><article><strong>01</strong><div><h3>确立风格定位</h3><p>研究用户偏好与市场趋势，将产品定位转译为可执行的角色视觉语言。</p></div></article><article><strong>02</strong><div><h3>搭建制作管线</h3><p>规范原画、模型、材质与引擎配置，协同内外部团队稳定交付。</p></div></article><article><strong>03</strong><div><h3>测试与品质验收</h3><p>建立效果测试与验收口径，持续平衡表现质量、性能与生产效率。</p></div></article></div>
    </div>
    <div class="zstar-collab z-reveal"><span>协作链路</span><b>原画设计</b><i>→</i><b>3D 美术</b><i>→</i><b>TA / 开发</b><i>→</i><b>产品运营</b></div>
  </section>

  <section class="zstar-section zstar-ai">
    <div class="zstar-section-index">04 / AI 效率驱动</div>
    <div class="zstar-heading z-reveal"><div><p class="zstar-kicker">AI WORKFLOW</p><h2>用 AI 加速概念探索，把时间留给关键判断。</h2></div><p>将 Stable Diffusion 与 ComfyUI 接入前期视觉流程，从原画方向、服装风格到角色氛围快速生成候选方案，缩短沟通与试错周期。</p></div>
    <div class="zstar-ai-grid z-reveal"><figure class="zstar-visual-card"><img src="<%- url_for('/images/portfolio-hd/zstar-ai-01.png') %>" alt="虚拟角色 AI 设计工作流"><figcaption><span>01</span><div><b>角色概念快速探索</b><p>多方向生成与筛选，快速对齐视觉目标。</p></div></figcaption></figure><figure class="zstar-visual-card"><img src="<%- url_for('/images/portfolio-hd/zstar-ai-02.png') %>" alt="AI 辅助虚拟角色效果优化"><figcaption><span>02</span><div><b>3D 方案辅助优化</b><p>围绕服装、材质与气质建立可制作参考。</p></div></figcaption></figure></div>
  </section>

  <section class="zstar-section zstar-pipeline">
    <div class="zstar-section-index">05 / 3D 资产生产</div>
    <div class="zstar-heading compact z-reveal"><div><p class="zstar-kicker">PRODUCTION PIPELINE</p><h2>把角色制作，变成可复用的生产系统。</h2></div><p>通过标准化节点与明确验收口径，降低跨团队协作损耗，并支持不同角色持续扩展。</p></div>
    <div class="zstar-pipeline-visual zstar-visual-card z-reveal"><img src="<%- url_for('/images/portfolio-hd/zstar-production.png') %>" alt="虚拟数字人 3D 美术资产制作管线"></div>
    <div class="zstar-pipeline-steps z-reveal"><span>原画设定</span><i>→</i><span>模型与材质</span><i>→</i><span>绑定与表情</span><i>→</i><span>引擎配置</span><i>→</i><span>效果验收</span></div>
  </section>

  <section class="zstar-system">
    <img src="<%- url_for('/images/portfolio-hd/zstar-avatar.png') %>" alt="幻星虚拟形象捏脸换装系统">
    <div class="zstar-system-shade"></div>
    <div class="zstar-system-copy z-reveal"><p class="zstar-kicker">06 / PRODUCT EXPERIENCE</p><h2>从角色资产，<br>走向可操作的产品体验。</h2><p>将发型、五官、服装与配饰拆分为可组合资产，让用户通过低门槛操作完成具有个人辨识度的虚拟形象。</p><div><span>模块化资产</span><span>实时预览</span><span>风格化组合</span></div></div>
  </section>

  <section class="zstar-section zstar-ip">
    <div class="zstar-section-index">07 / IP 角色视觉</div>
    <div class="zstar-heading compact z-reveal"><div><p class="zstar-kicker">CHARACTER SYSTEM</p><h2>让每个角色，都有清晰的记忆点。</h2></div><p>从性格、服装、配色到宣传场景建立统一视觉叙事，并结合 AI 辅助高效完成角色延展物料。</p></div>
    <div class="zstar-character-grid z-reveal">
      <% [['zstar-luna','LUNA','霓虹甜心'],['zstar-alicia','ALICIA','爱丽丝之梦'],['zstar-risa','RISA','疾风少女'],['zstar-dodo','DODO','萌趣朵朵'],['zstar-qingyi','QINGYI','墨舞丹青']].forEach(function(item){ %>
      <figure class="zstar-character-card"><img loading="lazy" src="<%- url_for('/images/portfolio-hd/' + item[0] + '.png') %>" alt="<%= item[2] %>角色视觉"><figcaption><span><%= item[1] %></span><b><%= item[2] %></b></figcaption></figure>
      <% }) %>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="zstar-results">
    <img src="<%- url_for('/images/portfolio-hd/zstar-lya.png') %>" alt="虚拟数字人 IP 孵化成果">
    <div class="zstar-results-shade"></div>
    <div class="zstar-results-copy z-reveal"><p class="zstar-kicker">08 / PROJECT OUTCOME</p><h2>从工具能力，<br>延伸至 IP 内容孵化。</h2><p>以代表性角色验证完整链路：角色定位、视觉资产、直播表达与宣传内容相互连接，使虚拟形象成为持续运营的品牌资产。</p><div><article><strong>产品</strong><span>完成捏脸换装系统的资产体系</span></article><article><strong>生产</strong><span>建立可协作、可验收的 3D 管线</span></article><article><strong>内容</strong><span>孵化多组差异化虚拟角色 IP</span></article></div></div>
  </section>

  <nav class="zstar-next"><span>NEXT PROJECT</span><a href="<%- url_for('/projects/mimo/') %>">嘟记豆 · AI 产品设计 →</a></nav>
</article>

<script>
document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded',function(){
  var reveal=document.querySelectorAll('.zstar-case .z-reveal');
  var observer=new IntersectionObserver(function(entries){entries.forEach(function(entry){if(entry.isIntersecting){entry.target.classList.add('is-visible');observer.unobserve(entry.target);}})},{threshold:.16});
  reveal.forEach(function(el){observer.observe(el);});
  document.querySelectorAll('.zstar-case .zstar-visual-card,.zstar-case .zstar-character-card,.zstar-case .zstar-phase-grid>article,.zstar-case .zstar-workstreams>article').forEach(function(card){card.addEventListener('pointermove',function(e){var r=card.getBoundingClientRect();card.style.setProperty('--mx',(e.clientX-r.left)+'px');card.style.setProperty('--my',(e.clientY-r.top)+'px');});});
  var hero=document.querySelector('.zstar-hero'),bg=hero&&hero.querySelector('.zstar-hero-bg'),canvas=hero&&hero.querySelector('.zstar-color-ripple'),cursor=hero&&hero.querySelector('.zstar-ripple-cursor');
  if(hero&&bg&&canvas){
    var ctx=canvas.getContext('2d'),mask=document.createElement('canvas'),mctx=mask.getContext('2d'),dpr=Math.min(window.devicePixelRatio||1,2),x=.66,y=.45,hover=false,revealed=false,burst=null,raf=0,trail=[],reduced=window.matchMedia('(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)').matches;
    function resize(){var r=hero.getBoundingClientRect();dpr=Math.min(window.devicePixelRatio||1,2);canvas.width=mask.width=Math.round(r.width*dpr);canvas.height=mask.height=Math.round(r.height*dpr);canvas.style.width=r.width+'px';canvas.style.height=r.height+'px';ctx.setTransform(dpr,0,0,dpr,0,0);mctx.setTransform(dpr,0,0,dpr,0,0);draw(performance.now());}
    function drawImageCover(target,dx,dy){var w=canvas.width/dpr,h=canvas.height/dpr,iw=bg.naturalWidth,ih=bg.naturalHeight,scale=Math.max(w/iw,h/ih),dw=iw*scale,dh=ih*scale;target.drawImage(bg,(w-dw)/2+(dx||0),(h-dh)*.42+(dy||0),dw,dh);}
    function ripplePath(cx,cy,r,t,amount){ctx.beginPath();for(var i=0;i<=160;i++){var a=i/160*Math.PI*2,rr=Math.max(0,r+Math.sin(a*9-t*.006)*amount+Math.sin(a*17+t*.004)*amount*.45),px=cx+Math.cos(a)*rr,py=cy+Math.sin(a)*rr;i?ctx.lineTo(px,py):ctx.moveTo(px,py);}ctx.closePath();}
    function drawWake(now){var w=canvas.width/dpr,h=canvas.height/dpr,duration=1420;trail=trail.filter(function(p){return now-p.t<duration});ctx.clearRect(0,0,w,h);mctx.clearRect(0,0,w,h);if(!trail.length){canvas.style.opacity='0';return}canvas.style.opacity='1';var strongest=0;for(var i=0;i<trail.length;i++){var p=trail[i],age=(now-p.t)/duration;if(age<=0||age>=1)continue;var radius=12+age*136,fadeIn=Math.min(1,age/.18),fadeOut=Math.pow(1-age,1.28),alpha=fadeIn*fadeOut;mctx.beginPath();mctx.arc(p.x,p.y,radius,0,Math.PI*2);mctx.fillStyle='rgba(255,255,255,'+alpha+')';mctx.fill();strongest=Math.max(strongest,Math.sin(Math.PI*age))}var refract=strongest*5,phase=now*.008;drawImageCover(ctx,Math.sin(phase)*refract,Math.cos(phase*.82)*refract);ctx.save();ctx.setTransform(1,0,0,1,0,0);ctx.globalCompositeOperation='destination-in';ctx.drawImage(mask,0,0);ctx.restore()}
    function draw(now){var w=canvas.width/dpr,h=canvas.height/dpr;if(revealed){ctx.clearRect(0,0,w,h);drawImageCover(ctx);return}if(burst){ctx.clearRect(0,0,w,h);var p=Math.min(1,(now-burst.start)/1250),ease=1-Math.pow(1-p,3),radius=burst.max*ease;canvas.style.opacity='1';if(p===1){revealed=true;burst=null;drawImageCover(ctx);hero.classList.add('is-color');return}ctx.save();ripplePath(x,y,radius,now,Math.max(4,radius*.018));ctx.clip();drawImageCover(ctx,Math.sin(now*.008)*2,Math.cos(now*.006)*2);ctx.restore()}else drawWake(now)}
    function start(){if(!raf&&!revealed)raf=requestAnimationFrame(function tick(now){raf=0;draw(now);if((trail.length||burst)&&!revealed)raf=requestAnimationFrame(tick);});}
    hero.addEventListener('pointerenter',function(e){if(e.pointerType==='touch')return;hover=true;if(cursor)cursor.classList.add('visible');});
    hero.addEventListener('pointermove',function(e){if(e.pointerType==='touch')return;if(revealed){if(cursor)cursor.classList.remove('visible');return}var r=hero.getBoundingClientRect(),px=e.clientX-r.left,py=e.clientY-r.top,last=trail[trail.length-1],now=performance.now();if(cursor){cursor.style.transform='translate3d('+(px-11)+'px,'+(py-11)+'px,0)';cursor.classList.toggle('visible',!e.target.closest('a,button'))}x=px;y=py;hover=true;if(!last||Math.hypot(px-last.x,py-last.y)>76){trail.push({x:px,y:py,t:now});if(trail.length>16)trail.shift()}start();});
    hero.addEventListener('pointerleave',function(){hover=false;if(cursor)cursor.classList.remove('visible');start();});
    hero.addEventListener('click',function(e){if(revealed||e.target.closest('a,button'))return;var r=hero.getBoundingClientRect();x=e.clientX-r.left;y=e.clientY-r.top;if(reduced){revealed=true;draw(performance.now());hero.classList.add('is-color');return}burst={start:performance.now(),max:Math.max(Math.hypot(x,y),Math.hypot(r.width-x,y),Math.hypot(x,r.height-y),Math.hypot(r.width-x,r.height-y))+30};trail=[];start();});
    if(bg.complete&&bg.naturalWidth)resize();else bg.addEventListener('load',resize,{once:true});window.addEventListener('resize',resize);
  }
});
</script>
